<title>USA: Carson Pirie June same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Carson Pirie June same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carson Pirie Scott &amp; Co said Thursday its June same-store sales for the five weeks ended July 5 were up 4.7 percent.</p>
<p>Total sales for that period increased 6.3 percent to $99.5 million.</p>
</text>
